{{Cnote2|Note 1|Grabar-Kitarović was elected to office as the official candidate of the [[Croatian Democratic Union]] (HDZ) in the [[2014–15 Croatian presidential election|2014–2015 election]], but is legally prohibited by Article 96 of the [[Constitution of Croatia|Constitution]] from holding any party membership for the entire duration of her term.<ref>{{Cite news|url=https://www.tportal.hr/vijesti/clanak/konacno-i-sluzbeno-grabar-kitarovic-je-pobjednica-izbora-20150210|title=Konačno i službeno: Grabar Kitarović je pobjednica izbora|publisher=tportal.hr|date=10 February 2015}}</ref> Thus, although not a member of a political party, she has been nominated by the Croatian Democratic Union and three other parties to be their candidate in the 2019–2020 election.<ref name=list/>}}
